---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const aboutJsonLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "AboutPage",
  "name": "About Tenda Peppers",
  "url": "https://drychillis.com/about/",
  "mainEntity": { "@id": "https://drychillis.com/#organization" }
};
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Tenda Peppers | Paprika & Chilli Manufacturer"
  description="Tenda Peppers is the paprika and dried chilli brand of Leling Tenda Chili Products Co., Ltd., a China manufacturer founded in 2010 with 12 growing bases and 10,000+ tonne annual capacity."
  jsonLd={[aboutJsonLd]}
>
  <div class="container section">
    <h1>About Tenda Peppers</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      Tenda Peppers is the paprika and dried chilli brand of Leling Tenda Chili Products Co.,
      Ltd., a manufacturer founded in 2010 in Leling, Shandong — a region known as China's
      "flavour capital".
    </p>

        <div class="product-media">
      <img src="/images/production-process.jpg" alt="Production process at Tenda Peppers" width="1039" height="692" loading="lazy" />
    </div>

    <p class="data-note" style="margin-top:10px;">Published by Tenda Peppers — Leling Tenda Chili Products Co., Ltd. (founded 2010, ISO 9001 &amp; HACCP certified). Last reviewed 2026-09-01.</p>

<h2 style="margin-top:32px;">Who We Are</h2>
    <p>
      We are a privately held manufacturer focused on one crop: chilli peppers. From 12 controlled
      growing bases we source chilli varieties across Shandong, Xinjiang and Henan, then dry, mill
      and grade them into paprika powder and dried chilli products for the food industry.
    </p>
    <table>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><strong>Company</strong></td><td>Leling Tenda Chili Products Co., Ltd.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Brand</strong></td><td>Tenda Peppers</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Founded</strong></td><td>2010</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Location</strong></td><td>Yang'an Town, Leling, Shandong, China</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Facility</strong></td><td>30,000 m² site, 16,000 m² buildings, cold storage</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Production</strong></td><td>3 high-standard lines + 1 conventional line</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Annual capacity</strong></td><td>10,000+ tonnes</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Team</strong></td><td>126 staff, 37 technical specialists</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Certifications</strong></td><td>ISO 9001, HACCP</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2 style="margin-top:32px;">Our Focus</h2>
    <p>
      Rather than spread across every spice category, we concentrate on the chilli pepper
      vertical. That focus lets us go deep on what matters to paprika and chilli buyers: variety
      selection, colour value (ASTA), heat level (SHU), mesh, moisture and batch consistency.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top:32px;">How We Operate</h2>
    <p>
      We run on four operating principles — <strong>sharing, innovation, efficiency and
      dedication</strong> — and one quality principle: <strong>zero defects, zero tolerance</strong>.
      That second principle is not marketing language; it is the acceptance standard every batch
      is held to before release, enforced by 24-hour surveillance and dedicated inspectors at
      each production stage.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top:32px;">From Farm to Milling</h2>
    <p>
      Our raw material comes from 12 controlled growing bases across Shandong, Xinjiang and
      Henan — China's major chilli-producing regions. Controlling the base means controlling the
      variety, the ripening-period climate exposure, and ultimately the heat, colour and flavour
      of every batch. This vertical integration — from field to finished powder — is the single
      biggest reason our product stays consistent shipment after shipment.
    </p>
    <p>
      Inside the factory, three high-standard production lines (plus one conventional line) run
      de-seeding, magnet filtration, X-ray inspection and colour sorting, supported by a large
      low-temperature warehouse that preserves colour and freshness before dispatch.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top:32px;">Certifications &amp; Recognition</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>ISO 9001:2015 quality management certification</li>
      <li>HACCP food safety certification</li>
      <li>Shandong "Food Safety" designation (2017, first batch)</li>
      <li>Municipal "Leading Enterprise" title</li>
      <li>China Condiment Association "Most Internationally Influential" enterprise</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="margin-top:32px;">Food Safety</h2>
    <p>
      Production runs under a zero-defect, zero-tolerance food safety system. Every batch passes
      de-seeding, magnet filtration, X-ray inspection and colour sorting, with raw-material
      acceptance controlled from approved suppliers and re-verified in our laboratory before
      entering production.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top:32px;">Markets</h2>
    <p>
      We supply food manufacturers, importers and distributors across Europe, the Middle East and
      North America, with one-stop custom specification — colour value, heat level, mesh and
      packaging matched to your requirement.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
